# spike

--- Cactus_Cover | gadget | TID_ACCESSORY_CACTUS_COVER_DESC
raw  Spike throws a large cactus with <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.maxHealth.scaleToLevel> health to give cover to teammates. If destroyed, the cactus bursts, and all nearby teammates recover <!card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel> health.
now  Spike throws a large cactus with 3500 health to give cover to teammates. If destroyed, the cactus bursts, and all nearby teammates recover <!card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel> health.
  card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.maxHealth.scaleToLevel  3500  -> 3500
  card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel  -  -> 1800

--- Cactus_Cover | gadget | TID_CACTUS_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DESC
raw  Spike throws a large cactus with <!card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.maxHealth.scaleToLevel> health to give cover to teammates. If destroyed, the cactus bursts, and all nearby teammates recover <!card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel> health. When destroyed, the plant also deals <!buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage.scaleToLevel> area damage that pushes enemies back.
now  Spike throws a large cactus with 3500 health to give cover to teammates. If destroyed, the cactus bursts, and all nearby teammates recover <!card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel> health. When destroyed, the plant also deals 1200 area damage that pushes enemies back.
  card.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.maxHealth.scaleToLevel  3500  -> 3500
  card.accessory.skill.cactusMinionHealing.scaleToLevel  -  -> 1800
  buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage.scaleToLevel  1200  -> 1200

--- Cactus_Cover | gadget | TID_CACTUS_BUDDY_GADGET_2_DIFF
raw  When destroyed, the plant also deals <!buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage.scaleToLevel> area damage that pushes enemies back.
now  When destroyed, the plant also deals 1200 area damage that pushes enemies back.
  buddy.accessory.skill.summonedCharacter.autoAttackDamage.scaleToLevel  1200  -> 1200

