--- Cactus_ShootAround | gadget | TID_CACTUS_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DESC
raw  Spike aims and fires a wave of needles that deal <!card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel> damage. Targets that are hit with 2 needles become rooted for <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.statusEffectEnemy.duration.ticksAsSeconds> sec.
now  Spike aims and fires a wave of needles that deal 1000 damage. Targets that are hit with 2 needles become rooted for 1 sec.
  card.accessory.skill.damage.scaleToLevel  1000  -> 1000
  buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.statusEffectEnemy.duration.ticksAsSeconds  1  -> 1

--- Cactus_ShootAround | gadget | TID_CACTUS_BUDDY_GADGET_1_DIFF
raw  Targets that are hit with 2 needles become rooted for <!buddy.accessory.skill.projectile.statusEffectEnemy.duration.ticksAsSeconds> seconds.
